  <name>PikaTalk</name>
  <summary>Native Plasma client for PicoClaw</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      PikaTalk is a native KDE Plasma desktop client for the local PicoClaw
      (PikaClaw) gateway. It keeps projects, chats, and messages on this
      computer and talks to PicoClaw over the local Pico Protocol WebSocket.
    </p>
  </description>
